@startuml
title D19 - Sequence tìm kiếm nguồn cung và gửi Offer
autonumber

actor Buyer
participant "React SPA" as Web
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Material Service" as Material
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Order Repository" as Repo
database "order_db" as DB

Buyer -> Web : Nhập từ khóa/bộ lọc
Web -> Gateway : GET /api/listings?keyword&category&location
Gateway -> Material : ListListings(...) [gRPC]
Material --> Gateway : Danh sách SupplyListing
Gateway --> Web : HTTP 200
Web --> Buyer : Hiển thị kết quả

Buyer -> Web : Chọn listing và nhập Offer
Web -> Gateway : POST /api/offers + JWT
Gateway -> Order : CreateOffer(request) [gRPC]
Order -> Order : Gán ID, status=pending
Order -> Repo : CreateOffer(offer)
Repo -> DB : INSERT offers
DB --> Repo : OK
Repo --> Order : OK
Order --> Gateway : Offer(pending)
Gateway --> Web : HTTP 201
Web --> Buyer : Hiển thị Offer đã gửi

note over Gateway,Order
  Code hiện tại chưa gọi Material Service
  để xác minh listing bên trong CreateOffer.
end note
@enduml

